  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "保持冷靜！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "都不要慌張！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崩潰的市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓讓，讓讓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "啼哭的市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們，那些怪物就快要過來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崩潰的市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴兜帽的傢伙，別擋住路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "啼哭的市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別過來！你身上有血！和那些怪物一樣沾上了血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我在這裡，抓住我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，抓住我的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……你？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你……不是阿米婭！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "變形者……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，應該是什麼樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你不再是過去那個你了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我聽到了Logos的骨哨聲。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眾魂依然拒斥了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……變化已經發生，我們的另一部分……已經離我們而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要做出選擇……我們不可停滯不前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們剛才試圖扮演你，但是失敗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……新的變形者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你的選擇？你決定真正與我們為敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們只是做出嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，我們的意義能否在和你的戰鬥中得出？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的路到底通向哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我曾經詢問上一位變形者我該怎麼做。他告訴我，我需跨越所有的猶豫和迷茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然新生的你仍稱呼我為“魔王”，那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己去找吧，在我這裡，你得不出答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我弄痛你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個叫阿斯卡綸的女人真討厭，她對所有人都那麼糾纏不休？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，小心——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他們的目標，是你！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小小的魔王啊，我早就迫不及待想要翻撿你的情感與記憶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原以為死魂靈會讓你吃點苦頭，可你的狀況似乎比我預想的要好上一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯，不，奇美拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終究不是特蕾西婭呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_425_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放開我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是個被人賦予王冠的幸運孩子，但你真的了解你的力量嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們，已經探究了魔王數個千年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別打博士的……主意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？被赦罪師的巫術環繞，你居然還能調動魔王的力量？我開始有些想念麗茲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，這對我們的實驗大有裨益。我會先留這位博士一命，我也會教你利用自己的情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過在把你交給首領之前，我得保證你比現在更乖一些，小兔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "變形者閣下，那個討厭的女人就快追過來了，後續就交給您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許，她能砥礪我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博……士……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！待在原地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一優先級是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "放開——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "放開阿米婭！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "呼——呼——呼——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "呼——呼——呼——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這……是什麼地方……這些石像……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它們……全都栩栩如生……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "薩卡茲種族的石像？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很頑強，“博士”，我很敬佩你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如此孱弱的身體，是如何跟隨我來到這裡的？我嘗試檢查你的身體，但是一無所獲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……也不是一無所獲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的構造……很特殊。和我所知的所有樣本都不一樣，我想要研究你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“仔細研究”。可惜這裡很久之前就被首領廢棄了，實驗設施不完整，我不想損壞你這麼珍貴的實驗體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是得帶回倫蒂尼姆嗎？可是特雷西斯好像對你格外關注……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你瞧啊，“博士”——她正看著什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在顫抖呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你對她做了什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王賜予偉大的幻境”。小兔子只是稍——微感受了一下她自己的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們沒必要互相敵對，你尋求知識？羅德島也有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "可笑的拉攏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你希望交換什麼？我們可以談談。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "無意義的談判。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "停下，否則我會讓你溺死在岩漿之中。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "帶著顫抖的威脅。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧你那一籌莫展、想抓住一切可能的樣子，看上去真令人心疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的幹員不在你的身邊，你的指揮派不上用場，現在，就連你所侍奉的“魔王”都在離你而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還能做得到什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我總是請教首領，權柄為何總被庸人把持？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些被歷史遺忘的魔王，給我們帶來的，除了顛沛流離的生活，還有什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，“博士”，你會是這次苦難的源頭之一嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你提出了很多疑問，但這裡不是個適合探討的地方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "只要你解除阿米婭身上的巫術，我願意盡力回答你。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我有和你相同的困惑，但傷害阿米婭無法帶來答案。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不討厭你的智慧。但說實在話，聰明人從來都不缺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何東西都換不來這次機會，都換不來我們數千年的追尋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼……既然她能把王冠強行戴上這個小兔子的腦袋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它也應該能被抽取出來才對呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你想偷走阿米婭的王冠！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偷？不不，這頂王冠不是個遺落在戰場上的鐵環，任人拾取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧，這是什麼，一枚——石頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "令人感動，但我必須提醒你，擋在她面前毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你如此執著，我想到了一個更好的辦法來處理你，“博士”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許你隱藏在兜帽下的腦袋裡，同樣也藏著不少有助於我們實驗的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣，不要抵抗我的巫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向我分享你的記憶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "從我的腦子裡滾出去！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼？什麼力量能這麼徹底地排斥赦罪師的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“魔王”……？可她的精神應該受到了巨大的限制……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*古老的薩卡茲語*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誕生自眾魂的枷鎖可沒那麼容易掙脫，她還停留在眾魂之間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在潛意識中依然選擇保護你，呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等等。不僅如此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和王冠的聯繫在加深……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！醒醒！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，如此濃烈的情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭當年會選擇你，好像不完全是走投無路，小兔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，那我們乾脆略過無聊的前奏吧。希望你的小腦袋瓜不會因此毀掉，那樣就太可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赦罪師在這座洞窟裡留下的，可不止是雕像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*薩卡茲咒語*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你答應過我——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "拒絕那個聲音！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你的行動太過魯莽，如果不是我遇到了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔的法術……你們對自己的……“血脈”擺弄到了何種地步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無法想像，你們是使徒閃靈的血親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那樣一位優異之人，卻要時刻為你們的污穢而懺悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，咳咳——女妖之主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虧你們能進入這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說如今的女妖之主相當叛逆，我真該再小心一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你比我們預期的更危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有審訊的餘力，情況緊急，殺了她，離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，這就是如今的女妖之主？“王庭喪鐘”？確實了得，這些咒文的精細程度不亞於你的英雄母親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可，你知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣精巧的符文——精巧的源石技藝，絕非薩卡茲最本初的心態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經離開了洞窟，阿斯卡綸在勘察附近的地形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的右臂橈骨被折斷了，我正在為你做基本的處理。我不是醫療幹員，只能做到這個程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭的情況怎麼樣？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……她還在昏迷。“受困於眾魂”，儘管赦罪師表露出類似含義，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，她性命無礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我理解阿斯卡綸對你行事的不滿，博士。她所擔心的，不僅有你的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你確實為我們爭取了時間，如果不是你的拖延，赦罪師恐怕已經帶著阿米婭躲藏進了倫蒂尼姆的高牆之後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那個赦罪師呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓她逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "土石，鮮血，還有……女妖之嘯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是赦罪師所期望的薩卡茲的模樣？執迷於……所謂的血統和巫術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他們的目標是“魔王”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們必須盡快轉告凱爾希和閃靈。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些氤氳的水氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不可能。博士，小心點。我們未必離開了敵人的陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "怎麼了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "很少見你的臉色變化。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡……不是維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是女妖的河谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
